{"id":"cf7108c33537548a","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-theory.md","title":"Theory","display":"df-theory — Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-theory","aliases":["93-df-theory"],"display":"df-theory — Theory","depends_on":["[[93-df-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory — Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is a set candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}\\)</span> is a closure-operator candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land T\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land\\mathrm{Cn}(T)=T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land T\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land\\mathrm{Cn}(T)=T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\mathrm{Th}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\coloneqq\n\\{T\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn}):\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\mathrm{Th}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\coloneqq\n\\{T\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn}):\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A theory is relative to an explicit consequence operator, whose domain fixes the formula universe; no ambient <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is silently captured.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-consequence]]; $\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Th}_{93}$ are defined here.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land T\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land\\mathrm{Cn}(T)=T","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\mathrm{Th}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\coloneqq\n\\{T\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn}):\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn})\\}","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":931,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc3498f98607795c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"In model theory a theory may be any set of sentences; deductive closure is not built into this predicate. The consequence-closed propositional notion remains [[93-df-theory]]."},{"id":"dce23e9e6907b821","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"882ddfff5f1c7a82","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ea98968ac191af8c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["afd7605d365be7b6"]}